      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-11-21T06:51:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Note that there are a few cards which say \"discard\" without involving a hand...usually they're discarding cards from the top of decks (eg Violent Nightmares or River of Lava).&nbsp; I believe such effects would get rid of Police Backup.&nbsp; What's not clear to me, though, is exactly how optional the discard can be and still automatically get rid of the cops.</p>",
